## Quick Reference

You are working on "Routine Ops: The Escalation Matrix" — a daily routine app
with an SRE-inspired escalation engine. Tasks degrade through tiers (L0→L4)
and impact a System Health Score.

## MANDATORY: Read These Before Writing Code

1. `.agent/project_context.md` — Core mechanics, entities, scoring
2. `.agent/design_system_rules.md` — Visual language, colors, components
3. `.agent/workflow_and_state_rules.md` — State machine, engine architecture
4. `.agent/system_prompt.txt` — Full behavioral rules for AI agents

## Critical Quick Rules

- TypeScript strict mode. Zero `any`.
- Tailwind CSS 4 with semantic tokens only (never raw hex).
- Motion library via `motion/react` (NOT `framer-motion`).
- Dexie.js for persistence. No global state stores.
- Engine functions are PURE — no side effects, injectable timestamps.
- TDD for escalation engine. Tests before implementation.
- Check `src/components/UI.tsx` before creating new primitives.
- All state colors resolved via `getEscalationClasses()`.
